Changelog:
Version 2.0.0
1) migrated to Manifest V3 (service worker background, chrome.storage.local)
2) replaced the chrometabcloud.appspot.com cloud sync with chrome.storage.sync
   (no server dependency); added a one-time optional import from the old
   TabCloud cloud account in the options page
Version 1.1.0
1) imported TabCloud plugin
2) added window tracking feature. 
